### 4.12 `GET /v1/status` — harness observability

Response `200`:
```json
{
  "agents": 6, "rooms": 4, "gateways": [
    { "id": "gw-main", "inflight": 2, "max_inflight": 4, "queued": 0 }
  ],
  "counters": {
    "sends_total": 118, "sends_deferred": { "backpressure": 3, "drained": 12 },
    "reports_missing_total": 2, "reprompts_total": { "0": 1, "1": 0, "2": 0 }
  }
}
```
(Counter names per DESIGN §3.4.)
